\title{Daskalopoulos 与 Mese，Harmonic Maps in Singular Geometry and Rigidity}
\date{2026-10-16}
\taxon{Reference}
\author{author}

\p{Georgios Daskalopoulos、Chikako Mese，Harmonic Maps in Singular Geometry and Rigidity，ICM 2026 Proceedings，Volume 4，103–120，[DOI 10.1137/25M1807630](https://doi.org/10.1137/25M1807630)。使用的预印本为 [arXiv:2510.13708v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.13708v1)，2025 年 10 月 15 日，[HTML 全文](https://arxiv.org/html/2510.13708v1)。该预印本按 [CC BY 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/) 许可发布；中文条目采用改编叙述，并另加基础推导。}
\p{§1 介绍光滑及度量目标的调和映射，§2 讨论建筑与 Teichmüller 空间的刚性，§3–§4 讨论奇点与非局部紧性，§5 讨论无限能量的多重调和映射。}
\p{度量 Sobolev 理论见 Korevaar–Schoen，Sobolev spaces and harmonic maps for metric space targets，Comm. Anal. Geom. 1 (1993)，561–659；建筑刚性见 Gromov–Schoen，Harmonic maps into singular spaces and p-adic superrigidity for lattices in groups of rank one，Publ. Math. IHÉS 76 (1992)，165–246。}
\p{拉回度量张量与方向能量见 Daskalopoulos–Wentworth，Harmonic Maps and Teichmüller Theory，[作者全文](https://math.umd.edu/~raw/papers/teich.pdf)，§2.3.3，式 (2.48)、(2.49)。}
\p{双曲建筑见 Daskalopoulos–Mese–Vdovina，Superrigidity of Hyperbolic Buildings，Geom. Funct. Anal. 21 (2011)，905–919，[作者全文](https://math.jhu.edu/~cmese/superrigidity_hyperbolic_building112110.pdf)。Teichmüller 刚性见 Daskalopoulos–Mese，Rigidity of Teichmüller Space，[正式论文](https://www.math.brown.edu/gdaskalo/HolRig.pdf)，Theorem 1.2；[arXiv:1502.03367](https://arxiv.org/abs/1502.03367)。}
\p{保持单一层的加强结果见 Yitong Sun，Regularity of Harmonic Maps into Teichmüller Space，[arXiv:2509.05506v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.05506v1)，Theorem 1.1。拟射影情形见 Brotbek–Daskalopoulos–Deng–Mese，Pluriharmonic Maps into Euclidean Buildings and Symmetric Differentials，[arXiv:2206.11835v4](https://arxiv.org/abs/2206.11835v4)，Theorem A、Definitions 2.15 与 3.8。}
